WEBVTT

00:03:58.542 --> 00:04:02.083
it's always perceived
as more sexual than it is.

00:04:03.125 --> 00:04:06.500
For me, I just wanted
to feel pretty and confident.

00:04:07.833 --> 00:04:09.583
What's so wrong with that?

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:13.684
Now, you might be thinking,

00:04:13.708 --> 00:04:17.541
"Well, can't you just
set your social media on private?"

00:04:19.625 --> 00:04:22.851
Well, these perpetrators were calculated.

00:04:22.875 --> 00:04:25.851
They befriended my friends on social media

00:04:25.875 --> 00:04:28.476
under fake profiles,

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:31.059
they followed the public galleries